evisions &amp; Client Sign-off\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"PYNGYN gives every client of your studio a standalone branded Client Space to review, feedback, and sign off work. Workspace, which runs your briefs, production, and revision rounds, is a separate product you can add.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/creative-services/\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"PYNGYN: Clientspace, a standalone branded client portal, and Workspace, a standalone back office for professional-services firms\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"PYNGYN: The operating system for professional-services firms\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Run your firm and every client engagement in one place. The operating system for professional-services firms.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-organization\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"legalName\":\"VIMOVI GlobalTech Private Limited\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/logo.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"image\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/icon.png\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN gives every client a branded Client Space (a standalone portal for status, documents, and approvals), with Workspace, the firm's back office for projects, finances, and billable time, available on its own or bundled together.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/Pyngyn_Official\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/pyngyn/\",\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Pyngyn_Official/\",\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61584474731354\",\"https://www.youtube.com/@PyngynOfficial\",\"https://instagram.com/pyngyn_official\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"email\":\"support@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/support\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"email\":\"sales@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/demo\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-website\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"The operating system for professional-services firms. Run your firm and every client engagement in one place.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[200] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-accent focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white\">Skip to content</a><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/creative-services#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/creative-services\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN for Creative Studios | Briefs, Revisions & Client Sign-off\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN gives every client of your studio a standalone branded Client Space to review, feedback, and sign off work. Workspace, which runs your briefs, production, and revision rounds, is a separate product you can add.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\"},\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/creative-services#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/creative-services#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Solutions\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/professional-services\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Creative Services\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/creative-services\"}]},{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/creative-services#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can PYNGYN track revision rounds against a scope limit?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Each project can have a defined number of revision rounds. PYNGYN tracks where you are against scope and alerts you before you exceed it.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How does Client Space work for creative feedback?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Clients receive work inside their branded portal, give structured feedback, and formally approve rounds there. Every version and comment is logged, no scattered email threads.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I track profitability on fixed-fee projects?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Team members log hours per project. The finance dashboard shows hours delivered vs budgeted and margin in real time, so you can act before going over, not after.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can multiple team members work on one client project?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The project is shared across the team with role-based access. Each person sees their tasks; the creative director sees the full picture.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does setup take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most studios have their first client project running inside a week. Set up a project from a template, invite the client to their Client Space, and start the brief-lock process on day one.\"}}]}]}</script><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[100] border-b transition-all duration-300 border-transparent bg-transparent\"><div class=\"wrap flex h-[68px] items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><div class=\"hidden h-full lg:flex lg:items-center\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-7 text-[15px] text-[#3a3a42]\"><a class=\"py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent\" href=\"/clientspace/\">Clientspace</a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Product<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Solutions<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Resources<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Compare<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/\" class=\"hidden text-[15px] font-semibold lg:inline \">Sign in</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"hidden px-4 py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"hidden px-[18px] py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-primary\">Book a demo</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-lg border lg:hidden border-line bg-white text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap pb-[60px] pt-[140px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Creative studios</span><h1 class=\"mt-4 max-w-[860px] font-display text-[clamp(34px,5.2vw,60px)] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.025em]\">Deliver creative work<br class=\"hidden sm:block\"/> <span class=\"text-accent\">on brief and on time.</span></h1><p class=\"lead mt-5 max-w-[680px]\">PYNGYN gives every client of your studio a standalone branded Client Space, to review work, leave feedback, and sign off rounds in one place instead of scattered email and PDFs. Add Workspace, a separate product, to run your briefs, production, and revision rounds internally.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-accent\">Book a demo</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Start free trial</a></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-[13px] text-muted\">30-min walkthrough on your firm&#x27;s workflows · No commitment</p></section><section class=\"wrap pb-[60px]\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[620px] overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ffbd2e]\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#28ca41]\"></span><span class=\"ml-2 truncate font-mono text-[11.5px] text-muted\">Lumen Studio · Brand Refresh</span></div><ul class=\"divide-y divide-line\"><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5\"><span class=\"text-[14px] text-ink\">Creative brief signed off</span><span class=\"rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-positive/10 text-positive\">Done</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5\"><span class=\"text-[14px] text-ink\">Concept exploration</span><span class=\"rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-accent-lt text-accent-dk\">In progress</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5\"><span class=\"text-[14px] text-ink\">Design production</span><span class=\"rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-accent-lt text-accent-dk\">In progress</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3.5\"><span class=\"text-[14px] text-ink\">Client sign-off</span><span class=\"rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold bg-[#fff3cd] text-[#92400e]\">At risk</span></li></ul><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-t border-line bg-positive/5 px-5 py-3\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex-none text-positive\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v6l3 3\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[12.5px] text-positive\">PYNGYN flagged 1 task at risk: sign-off depends on production, which is 2 days behind.</span></div></div></section><section class=\"section bg-[#fbfbfd]\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Why firms switch</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[760px] font-display text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]\">The problems every creative studios knows.</h2><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-[18px] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"index-num\">01</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug\">Briefs misunderstood at handoff</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">The brief goes in, the first concepts come back, and the client says that is not what they meant. Two rounds wasted because the brief was never locked.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"index-num\">02</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug\">Revision rounds go over</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Three rounds are in scope. The client is on round six. Nobody tracked the extras, and the conversation about scope is awkward to have after the fact.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"index-num\">03</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug\">Feedback scattered everywhere</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Notes come in by email, voice memo, marked-up PDF, and in comments on a shared file. Consolidating them is its own project.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"index-num\">04</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug\">Deadlines slip without warning</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Production depends on a client decision that has not come. The deadline risk is invisible until you are already late.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"index-num\">05</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug\">No live profitability per project</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Fixed-fee projects live and die by hours spent. You find out you went over at billing, not when you could have reset scope.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"index-num\">06</div><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug\">Client confusion at delivery</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">The client is not sure what they approved, when, or what is still outstanding. Sign-off turns into a back-and-forth.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The client portal</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-accent/40 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-accent\">Client Space</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]\">A branded portal for every client.<span class=\"block text-accent\">$19 per client / month, standalone.</span></h2><p class=\"lead mt-4 max-w-[640px]\">Give each client their own isolated, white-labeled portal. They see what you want them to see, nothing from your other clients.</p><ul class=\"mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"card flex items-start gap-3\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Branded client portal per project</span></li><li class=\"card flex items-start gap-3\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Brief lock and approval at kickoff</span></li><li class=\"card flex items-start gap-3\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Consolidated feedback and revision rounds</span></li><li class=\"card flex items-start gap-3\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Final sign-off with a versioned approval record</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"section bg-[#fbfbfd]\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">The engine</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-muted\">Workspace</span></div><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.025em]\">Your firm&#x27;s operating system.<span class=\"block text-accent\">$9 per seat / month.</span></h2><p class=\"lead mt-4 max-w-[640px]\">Everything your team needs to run creative studios work, with AI that keeps plans, status, and risk current automatically.</p><ul class=\"mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"card flex items-start gap-3\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Project plans with brief lock, production, and sign-off phases</span></li><li class=\"card flex items-start gap-3\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Revision round tracking with scope limits</span></li><li class=\"card flex items-start gap-3\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Billable timesheet logging per client project</span></li><li class=\"card flex items-start gap-3\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Business Brain AI: drafts status and flags overdue feedback</span></li><li class=\"card flex items-start gap-3\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-positive\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15px]\">Roles for creative directors, designers, and producers</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Pricing</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Simple and predictable.</h2><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[520px]\">Choose Client Space, Workspace, or bundle both for $24.99/mo.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 text-[15px]\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-accent bg-accent/5 px-6 py-4 text-center shadow-soft\"><div class=\"font-display text-[32px] font-semibold\">$19</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-muted\">per client / month · Client Space</div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"font-display text-[32px] font-semibold\">$9</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-muted\">per seat / month · Workspace</div></div><span class=\"text-[22px] text-muted\">or bundle for</span><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white px-6 py-4 text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"font-display text-[32px] font-semibold\">$24.99</div><div class=\"mt-1 text-muted\">/mo · both together</div></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-accent\">Start free trial</a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo</a></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-[13px] text-muted\">Enterprise pricing available for larger firms ·<!-- --> <a class=\"underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/pricing/\">Full pricing →</a></p></div></section><section class=\"section bg-[#fbfbfd]\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAQ</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(24px,3vw,32px)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]\">Questions from creative studios.</h2><div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-[18px] md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">Can PYNGYN track revision rounds against a scope limit?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Yes. Each project can have a defined number of revision rounds. PYNGYN tracks where you are against scope and alerts you before you exceed it.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">How does Client Space work for creative feedback?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Clients receive work inside their branded portal, give structured feedback, and formally approve rounds there. Every version and comment is logged, no scattered email threads.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">How do I track profitability on fixed-fee projects?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Team members log hours per project. The finance dashboard shows hours delivered vs budgeted and margin in real time, so you can act before going over, not after.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">Can multiple team members work on one client project?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Yes. The project is shared across the team with role-based access. Each person sees their tasks; the creative director sees the full picture.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16.5px] font-bold leading-snug\">How long does setup take?</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Most studios have their first client project running inside a week. Set up a project from a template, invite the client to their Client Space, and start the brief-lock process on day one.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap text-center\"><p class=\"text-[14px] text-muted\">Not exactly your firm?<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-accent hover:underline\" href=\"/solutions/professional-services/\">See all professional-services verticals →</a></p></div></section><section id=\"demo\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-7 py-[72px] text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-[420px] w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-lt opacity-70 blur-[80px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"eyebrow relative\">Ready when you are</span><h2 class=\"title relative mx-auto mt-3.5 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px)]\">Stop managing the tool. Start shipping the work.</h2><p class=\"lead relative mx-auto mt-[18px]\">See PYNGYN run a real project in 30 minutes, and let AI handle the project management busywork.</p><div class=\"relative mt-[30px] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo →</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a></div><p class=\"relative mt-4 text-sm text-muted\">30-minute walkthrough · Tailored to your team · No commitment</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-white pt-16 pb-10 text-sm text-muted\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(5,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"mb-4 inline-block\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><p class=\"max-w-[230px] leading-relaxed\">The operating system for professional-services firms.</p><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.pyngyn.io&amp;hl=en_IN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2.5 transition-colors hover:border-accent\" aria-label=\"Get PYNGYN on Google Play\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.6 2.3 13 12 3.6 21.7a1.4 1.4 0 0 1-.6-1.2V3.5c0-.5.2-.9.6-1.2z\" fill=\"#34a853\"></path><path d=\"M16.8 8.6 13 12 3.6 2.3c.4-.3.9-.3 1.4 0l8.8 5z\" fill=\"#ea4335\"></path><path d=\"M16.8 15.4 5 22c-.5.