"Creative Services\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/creative-services\\\"}]},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://pyngyn.ai/solutions/creative-services#faq\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can PYNGYN track revision rounds against a scope limit?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. Each project can have a defined number of revision rounds. PYNGYN tracks where you are against scope and alerts you before you exceed it.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How does Client Space work for creative feedback?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Clients receive work inside their branded portal, give structured feedback, and formally approve rounds there. Every version and comment is logged, no scattered email threads.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How do I track profitability on fixed-fee projects?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Team members log hours per project. The finance dashboard shows hours delivered vs budgeted and margin in real time, so you can act before going over, not after.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can multiple team members work on one client project?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. The project is shared across the team with role-based access. Each person sees their tasks; the creative director sees the full picture.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How long does setup take?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Most studios have their first client project running inside a week. Set up a project from a template, invite the client to their Client Space, and start the brief-lock process on day one.\\\"}}]}]}a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\