you can act before going over, not after.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can multiple team members work on one client project?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. The project is shared across the team with role-based access. Each person sees their tasks; the creative director sees the full picture.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does setup take?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Most studios have their first client project running inside a week. Set up a project from a template, invite the client to their Client Space, and start the brief-lock process on day one.\"}}]}]}a:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L12\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"id\":\"main\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap pb-[60px] pt-[140px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":\"Creative studios\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 max-w-[860px] font-display text-[clamp(34px,5.2vw,60px)] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.025em]\",\"children\":[\"Deliver creative work\",[\"$\",\"br\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden sm:block\"}],\" \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-accent\",\"children\":\"on brief and on time.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"lead mt-5 max-w-[680px]\",\"children\":\"PYNGYN gives every client of your studio a standalone branded Client Space, to review work, leave feedback, and sign off rounds in one place instead of scattered email and PDFs. Add Workspace, a separate product, to run your briefs, production, and revision rounds internally.\"}],\"$L13\",\"$L14\"]}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\"]}],\"$L1d\"],[\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\"],\"$L20\"]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"children\":\"$L22\"}],[\"$\",\"div